  "Meaning": "Reconstructs measured per-command stages from all twelve completed source-pinned clean worker-count captures. Automap discovery is paid each ordinary world tic even when the automap is hidden, preserving mapped lines.420 game updates/discovery/snapshot samples and420 ordered audio-publication QPC spans per run;419 adjacent command intervals. Presentation residual includes checkpoint work, observer overhead and descheduling; intercommand residual includes ready/control/read/host availability, not pure wait or exact update-start telemetry. Simulation stopwatch duration and QPC end are adjacent observations, so derived starts/residuals are approximate. Full release-gate denominators are unchanged; no whole-host improvement or causal scheduler attribution. Discovery5\u20136 ms remains substantial next optimization target; do not omit it or its mapped-line semantics."
